data: {"id": "f7ca760edf0140b5-thinking-parallel_evidence-557", "run_id": "f7ca760edf0140b5", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突和缺口\n\n**实体身份确认**\n- Pod `workload-79d9f8fd88-bwqhh` 位于 `aiops-case-10` 命名空间，节点 `node2`，IP `172.16.104.32`。\n- 资源 UID: `f2db1889-e2c8-4073-b40b-7603dc07e25a`。\n\n**支持 CrashLoopBackOffRuntime 的事实**\n- **状态证据**：`kubectl_get` 显示 Pod 状态为 `CrashLoopBackOff`，重启次数 18 次（最近 2m50s 前一次）。\n- **事件证据**：`kubectl_describe` 记录到 `Liveness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 500`，且 kubelet 报告 `Back-off restarting failed container`。\n- **退出码证据**：容器主进程退出码为 `137` (SIGKILL)，通常由 OOM 或 Liveness Probe 强杀导致。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788817338978, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

